{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>אחז</b> Two times in the Masorah: דין (judgment) and the other אחז בקרנות המזבח (he grasped the horns of the altar) — teaches that trembling and fear seized him, and he needed to grasp the horns of the altar. And further, one from another wording: שמאל בעשותו (his left hand in his doing) and not אחז."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:03.461516357Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}